      "message": "Hey Stephen, I wonder how we can resolve this... The testing here relies on the ability to format the output (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/tools/pdl/src/test_utils.rs).\n\nAm I misunderstanding that this change will remove `rustfmt` from the `$PATH`? If the tests can still find a `rustfmt` somewhere on the `$PATH`, things will continue to work (it would not be a proper hygienic build, but `rustfmt` is pretty stable).",
